flowchart TD
  CI[Repository CI] --> Helper[Helper and metadata checks]
  CI --> Starter[Starter checks]
  CI --> Reference[Reference checks]
  CI --> Wrong[Selected incorrect implementations]
  Starter --> Expected[Exact expected assertion failures]
  Reference --> Pass[Acceptance passes]
  Wrong --> Reject[Meaningful mistakes rejected]
  Attempt[Learner attempt] --> Local[Same acceptance checks locally]
  Local --> Evidence[Behavioral evidence only]
